.massigra.net/","text":"シンプルで高速な画像ビューワ「MassiGra」の、作者のウェブサイトです。 MassiGra (マッシグラ) は、累計ダウンロード数 70 万以上の、Windows 用のフリーソフトウェアです。","image_url":"http://www.massigra.net/img/intro1234.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"massigra.net","service_icon":"http://www.massigra.net/favicon.ico","from_url":"http://www.massigra.net/","original_url":"http://www.massigra.net/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mzl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52738d0f-e125-45d8-a54d-cb242082ea2b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Windows で、商用利用でも無料のいい感じ(曖昧)な画像ビューアってありますかね?\n今、普段は XnView っての使ってて、昔は IrfanView っての使ってたんですけど、どっちも商用利用は有料なんですよね","ts":"1626322589.424800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MD7P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"277085f7-764a-4840-938d-ea4e2d697b8a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"やはり問題は値段か。個人でも気軽に使えるレベルだと良さそう","ts":"1626322092.423300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xOJi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d5065f3-2ba9-4340-b51b-9f73509750a7","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"webブラウザなどから…ってありますがどうなんでしょうね。\nelectronベースのクライアントアプリとかはありそうだけど敢えているかというと…","ts":"1626319760.422700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"56q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"955f5941-e43a-490b-915e-14dd1be6d2ef","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Amazon WorkSpaces みたいな感じにクライアント提供する形なんだろうか。","ts":"1626319349.420600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1c+sS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b8c3161-79c7-4fcc-ab0e-52a4d2b8dd39","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"難しそうだとは思ってる","ts":"1626282137.420000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z6U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56724c83-3a7b-4665-b5ef-a017a0810cf7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"個人で使えるような金額なら契約してみたいが、はたして","ts":"1626282131.419700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vr9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DFB9470C-C2DC-439A-8479-2D873BFD7181","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1338124.html|https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1338124.html\u003e","ts":"1626282003.418700","attachments":[{"fallback":"PC Watch: Microsoft、月額制クラウドPC「Windows 365」を8月提供開始。Windows 11にも対応","id":1,"title":"Microsoft、月額制クラウドPC「Windows 365」を8月提供開始。Windows 11にも対応","title_link":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1338124.html","text":"　Microsoftは14日(米国太平洋時間、日本時間7月15日未明)、販売パートナーなどを対象にしたカンファレンス「Inspire 2021」に先だって報道発表を行ない、SaaS(Software as a Service)型の仮想デスクトップとなる「Windows 365」を発表した。同社はAzure Virtual Desktop(AVD)と呼ばれるクラウドベースの仮想デスクトップサービスを提供しているが、AVDが従量制課金でIaaS(Infrastructure as a Service)で青天井の料金であるのに対して、Windows 365では月額固定料金で使えるのが違いとなる。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1338/124/001.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1626274800,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1338124.html","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1338124.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL","U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W7LLU"}]}]
